RECOMMENDED PRODUCTS
Odoo already renders a carousel under the product description whenever a
product has alternative products set (website_sale.alternative_products, active
by default). Two things make it unusable as shipped on this platform:

- Its headings read "Alternative Products" / "These other products might
  interest you". Odoo's own Spanish catalogue leaves both untranslated, so the
  es_ES arch of that view still says "Alternative Products" in English.
- "Alternative" is the wrong word for a directory of independent local shops:
  the block is not offering a substitute, it is recommending more of what this
  shop sells.

So the headings are replaced with our own — which do get translated, through
this module's i18n/es.po — and the title picks up the platform colour.
-->
<odoo>

    <template id="recommended_products_heading"
              inherit_id="website_sale.alternative_products"
              name="Recommended Products Heading">
        <!-- data-name is the label the website editor shows for the block; keep
             it in step with what the visitor reads. -->
        <xpath expr="//section[hasclass('s_dynamic_snippet_products')]" position="attributes">
            <attribute name="data-name">Recommended Products</attribute>
        </xpath>
        <xpath expr="//section[hasclass('s_dynamic_snippet_title')]//h4" position="replace">
            <h4 class="shop-recommended-title">You may also like</h4>
        </xpath>
        <xpath expr="//section[hasclass('s_dynamic_snippet_title')]//p[hasclass('lead')]"
               position="replace">
            <p class="lead">Other products from this shop that may interest you</p>
        </xpath>
    </template>

    <template id="recommended_products_styles"
              inherit_id="website_sale.alternative_products"
              name="Recommended Products Styles">
        <xpath expr="//section[hasclass('s_dynamic_snippet_title')]" position="before">
            <style type="text/css">
                .o_wsale_alternative_products {
                    border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6 !important;
                }
                .o_wsale_alternative_products .shop-recommended-title {
                    color: #714B67 !important;
                    font-weight: 700 !important;
                }
                .o_wsale_alternative_products .lead {
                    font-size: 1rem !important;
                    color: #6c757d !important;
                }
            </style>
        </xpath>
    </template>

</odoo>
